lvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">DeepSeek发布新一代大模型DeepSeek-V4，支持百万上下文并实现极致定价</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">OpenAI开源隐私过滤模型Privacy Filter，支持本地化PII脱敏处理</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">OpenAI 在 ChatGPT 中推出 Workspace Agents 智能体支持团队协作</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">谷歌DeepMind推出解耦式DiLoCo架构，提升异步训练容错率与效率</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/216c63f43c702d3c66ec5d571818a6c2.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">谷歌DeepMind发布新型分布式训练架构“解耦式DiLoCo”，旨在提升大规模AI模型训练的鲁棒性与硬件故障容忍度。该架构将训练任务分散至多个异步、故障隔离的“学习单元”，各单元在本地完成多次梯度计算后，将压缩后的梯度信息异步传输至外部优化器汇总。此设计打破了传统数据并行训练对紧密同步的依赖，有效避免单点故障导致的整体停滞。实验数据显示，在高硬件故障率环境下，DiLoCo仍能维持88%的利用率，远高于标准方法的27%。此外，该架构将跨数据中心带宽需求从198 Gbps大幅降至0.84 Gbps，显著降低了全球分布式训练的门槛。DiLoCo具备自愈能力，支持在学习单元失效后继续训练并无缝重连，同时兼容不同代数的TPU芯片等异构硬件，有效延长了旧设备使用寿命并缓解了硬件容量瓶颈。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">福客AI获阿里巴巴战略投资，将共同推进AI Agent在电商领域的应用</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/b570857c3f4a649f26e8c4d9abe20396.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">福客AI近日宣布获得阿里巴巴战略投资，双方将聚焦电商领域数字生产力提升，推动AI技术深度融入商家运营流程。此次合作旨在通过AI Agent技术，全面覆盖电商服务、导购、商品、交易及售后等关键环节，显著提升客户接待效率、服务体验及整体经营质量。福客AI将利用该笔投资强化产品研发与落地体系，助力商家构建完善的数字生产力体系。阿里巴巴通过此次注资，意在将其电商生态系统与福客AI的技术能力深度结合，推动行业向智能化、数字化转型。对于电商企业而言，AI Agent将成为提升运营效率与市场竞争力的核心工具，标志着电商运营模式正向智能化执行迈进。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">DeepSeek发布新一代大模型DeepSeek-V4，支持百万上下文并实现极致定价</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/96e1a439272c9263333d3cd96c192d9c.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">DeepSeek于4月24日正式发布新一代大模型DeepSeek-V4，该模型在数学、STEM及竞赛代码评测中超越现有开源模型，整体性能比肩顶级闭源模型。DeepSeek-V4支持100万tokens超长上下文，并推出Flash与Pro双版本：Flash版侧重轻量高效，Pro版则在Agent能力与世界知识储备上表现卓越，仅次于Gemini-Pro-3.1。在定价策略上，DeepSeek延续极致性价比，Flash版输入/输出价格分别为1元/2元（每百万tokens），Pro版则为12元/24元。此次发布旨在降低顶级模型使用门槛，为复杂长文档分析、超长代码生成及多轮Agent任务提供高性能且低成本的解决方案，进一步推动开源AI领域的技术迭代与应用落地。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">OpenAI开源隐私过滤模型Privacy Filter，支持本地化PII脱敏处理</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/ed9417a97357bf4ad41be85508f85d78.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">OpenAI正式开源隐私过滤模型Privacy Filter，该模型专为检测并脱敏文本中的个人身份信息（PII）而设计。Privacy Filter基于gpt-oss架构改造为双向token分类器，总参数量为15亿，活跃参数为5000万，并支持12.8万token的超长上下文处理。该模型具备极高的部署灵活性，支持在浏览器或笔记本电脑等本地环境运行，确保敏感数据无需上传至云端即可完成处理。在PII-Masking-300k基准测试中，该模型表现优异，F1分数达到96%，修正后可提升至97.43%。此次开源为开发者提供了高效的本地化隐私保护方案，有效降低了处理敏感文本时的合规风险与数据泄露隐患，是构建安全AI应用的重要技术组件。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">OpenAI 在 ChatGPT 中推出 Workspace Agents 智能体支持团队协作</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/e189c960baf28424a890510b7398c525.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">OpenAI 于 4 月 23 日发布 Workspace Agents，旨在通过 ChatGPT 平台支持团队创建协作智能体，处理复杂任务与长周期工作流。该功能由 Codex 提供底层支持，具备文件处理、代码运行、工具调用及记忆存储能力，支持全天候云端运行。Workspace Agents 可集成 Slack 并支持定时调度，能够自动执行报告准备、代码编写及消息响应等任务。目前 OpenAI 内部已部署软件审查员、产品反馈路由器等 5 种应用实例，有效将隐性知识转化为显性工作流。该功能现面向 ChatGPT Business、Enterprise、Edu 及 Teachers 计划用户开放研究预览，在 2026 年 5 月 6 日前可免费使用，后续将转为积分计费模式。未来 OpenAI 计划引入自动触发器与性</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
